Unofficial Valgrind fork maintained by the hotpath-rs project
=============================================================

This is NOT an official Valgrind release and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the Valgrind project. The official sources are at
https://sourceware.org/git/valgrind.git and https://valgrind.org/.

Fork: https://github.com/hotpath-rs/valgrind
Base: upstream tag VALGRIND_3_28_0 (Valgrind 3.28.0)
Version string: 3.28.0.hotpath1 (`valgrind --version`, Callgrind `creator:`)


